# Only interop/gopenpgp-cli/ is copied into the image (docker/Dockerfile, stage 4).
# The rest stays out of the build context: keys/ holds root-only gpg homes after a
# benchmark run, which made `make image` fail, and data/ holds the 1 GB input.
# Plain excludes only: an exception (!) would make Docker walk into keys/ again.
.git
keys
data
tmp
results
figures
tables
analysis
bench
measure
.venv
**/__pycache__
